    "id": "32cf505a4efbb214",
    "type": "subflow",
    "name": "POST entries",
    "info": "Routes entries to the correct POST subflow based on the target system.\n\n### Input\n`msg.entry` — bridge entry with `entry.metadata.failed_files` set by the GET side.\n\n### Logic\n1. Bridge entry to client handles attachment failures, patches entry.text for\n   non-upload destinations (WaSOS), and builds msg.payload in the target system format.\n   Notifications for WaSOS are fired via internal link-call inside Bridge entry to client.\n2. Switch routes on msg.metadata.target.client_system (set by the Bridge adapter).\n3. POST to WaSOS chat / POST to Rayvn log posts to the target system.\n   Notifications for Rayvn are fired via internal link-call inside POST to Rayvn log.\n\n### Output 1\nPOST response from both destinations (msg.result set by Return response).\n\n### Notifications\nHandled internally in Bridge entry to client and POST to Rayvn log via link-call —\ndo not surface through subflow output ports.",
